    Original project: https://github.com/koi128bit/WorkBuddy-Switch

(c) If the distributed product has a user interface, also display that
    notice in a normally accessible About, Credits or Legal Notices view.
    A network service using Covered Material must display it in such a view
    or in a legal/credits page linked from the service interface or public
    documentation. A headless service or command-line tool may use its
    public documentation or an accessible credits/license command instead;
    no graphical interface must be created solely for this requirement.

(d) Make the repository URL clickable wherever the display format supports
    hyperlinks. Otherwise reproduce the complete URL as readable text.
    Do not conceal, make illegible, or misleadingly relabel the notice.
    No splash screen, advertisement or fixed toolbar branding is required.

(e) Clearly state that your product is modified or derived when applicable,
    and describe the reused component or contribution in its documentation.
    Do not present the original author's contribution as solely your own,
    or suggest the original author endorses your product.

These are conditions of the permissions in section 2, not merely requests.
